note top of AuthService
  **Khac biet so voi so do goc**
  So do goc co revokeRefreshToken()/revokeAllRefreshTokens()
  (gia dinh co bang refresh_tokens).
  Theo docs/architecture.md muc 2.4: token la stateless,
  KHONG co bang refresh_tokens -> dung **tokenVersion**.
  Vi vay UserRepository dung incrementTokenVersion().
end note

note right of QueueManager
  **Queue (BullMQ)** dung cho 3 module:
  - AI: content-generation-queue
  - Post: publishing-queue
  - Workspace/Notification: email-queue
  (khop voi workers/queues.ts hien co)
end note

note bottom of N8nClient
  **n8n CHI dung cho Post Analytics** — dong bo metrics
  Facebook (Phan he 8, D21). KHONG tham gia dang bai.
  - Dang bai: BullMQ (`publishing-queue` + PublishingWorker).
  - Admin/Order/AI/Workspace/Auth: KHONG dung n8n.
    Admin = query DB dong bo; Order = cron + webhook;
    AI/Email = da co BullMQ worker.
  - MetricsSyncWorkflow chay dinh ky (n8n cron), goi
    Facebook Graph API roi ghi/upsert `PostMetric`.
end note

note bottom of FacebookClient
  **D13**: MVP nhap `pageId` + `pageAccessToken` thu cong
  (khong OAuth redirect). `appId`/`appSecret` lay tu **bien
  moi truong**, khong luu DB. Chi `accessToken` (Page Token)
  duoc ma hoa AES-256 luu DB.
end note

